<title>GERMANY: Arcor wins large Karstadt order.</title>
<headline>Arcor wins large Karstadt order.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mannesmann Arcor has won an order to set up a Germany-wide telecommunications network linking 800 locations for retailer Karstadt, Mannesmann said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Mannesmann Arcor, which uses the rail lines of Deutsche Bahn AG for its telephone network, is Germany's second-largest supplier of telecommunications services.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
